MODULE: ResolvedLateDuplicateProjected
TARGET: ProjectionOnce
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: Ignore same-owner resolved suppression and project late duplicate prepares and terminals again
PERTURBS: Read

--- FIND
          /\ prepared' = IF ~resolved /\ i \in {1,3} THEN TRUE ELSE prepared
          /\ terminal' = IF ~resolved /\ i \in {2,4} THEN TRUE ELSE terminal
--- REPLACE
          /\ prepared' = IF i \in {1,3} THEN TRUE ELSE prepared
          /\ terminal' = IF i \in {2,4} THEN TRUE ELSE terminal
--- END
